<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Surya Toto first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Surya Toto first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>					  (in billion rupiah)</p>
<p>    Net income			10.53	  vs    9.87</p>
<p>    Sales			     68.62	  vs    63.61</p>
<p>    Operating expenses	     9.43	  vs    8.91</p>
<p>    Operating profit		18.62	  vs   17.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  14.06	  vs   12.87</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     87.41	  vs   64.08</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Surya Toto is a sanitary ware and plumbing fittings manufacturer.</p>
